WEBVTT

1
00:00:10.667 --> 00:00:15.637
Tristay: What . . . what is that?

2
00:00:15.638 --> 00:00:26.233
Danny: A rainbow! It has all the colors imaginable. It’s beautiful!

3
00:00:26.234 --> 00:00:28.175
Tristay: Ha-ha, you fool.

4
00:00:28.176 --> 00:00:36.013
More color will only make me stronger.

5
00:00:36.014 --> 00:00:40.357
Tristay: I . . . I feel . . . strange.

6
00:00:40.358 --> 00:00:47.449
There is . . . so much color. . .

7
00:00:47.450 --> 00:00:49.831
Tina: What’s happening?

8
00:00:49.832 --> 00:00:51.591
Brad: Look at Tristay.

9
00:00:51.592 --> 00:00:54.146
He’s acting strange!

10
00:00:54.147 --> 00:01:04.897
Danny: It’s working, it’s working!

11
00:01:04.898 --> 00:01:07.615
Tina: Something’s happening to the ground!

12
00:01:07.616 --> 00:01:12.528
Brad: Life is coming back to the mountaintop!

13
00:01:12.529 --> 00:01:21.977
Tristay: Something . . . is happening . . . to me . . .

14
00:01:21.978 --> 00:01:25.503
Hopian: Danny, look out!

15
00:01:25.504 --> 00:01:29.928
Danny: Hopian, you’re okay!

16
00:01:29.929 --> 00:01:31.708
Hopian: Watch out, everyone.

17
00:01:31.709 --> 00:01:34.707
He’s going to explode!

18
00:01:34.708 --> 00:01:41.436
Tristay: Too much color . . . inside . . . I can’t . . . hold it . . . all in.

19
00:01:41.437 --> 00:01:56.182
Tristay: It’s all . . . coming . . . to . . . an end. Oh no! Ahhhhhhh!

20
00:01:56.183 --> 00:01:59.236
Brad: What . . . what just happened?

21
00:01:59.237 --> 00:02:04.265
Tina: Where’s Tristay?

22
00:02:04.266 --> 00:02:06.350
Danny: We defeated him!

23
00:02:06.351 --> 00:02:08.821
Tristay is gone, isn’t he?

24
00:02:08.822 --> 00:02:12.423
Hopian: Yes, he is!

25
00:02:12.424 --> 00:02:16.251
Danny: I told you we could do it, I told you!

26
00:02:16.252 --> 00:02:18.236
Tina: You were great, Danny!

27
00:02:18.237 --> 00:02:20.385
Your rainbow did it!

28
00:02:20.386 --> 00:02:22.167
Bello: Rainbow!

29
00:02:22.168 --> 00:02:29.765
Danny: We all did it!

30
00:02:29.766 --> 00:02:32.109
Tina: What happened to Tristay?

31
00:02:32.110 --> 00:02:35.523
Hopian: The colors of the rainbow were too much for him.

32
00:02:35.524 --> 00:02:38.218
Hopian: He couldn’t absorb them all.

33
00:02:38.219 --> 00:02:41.486
Danny: Like eating too much ice cream makes you sick?

34
00:02:41.487 --> 00:02:44.405
Hopian: Yes, something like that.

35
00:02:44.406 --> 00:02:48.475
The colors burst out and destroyed him.

36
00:02:48.476 --> 00:02:54.157
Brad: Hey, here’s the rainbow that you threw into the air.

37
00:02:54.158 --> 00:02:56.424
Danny: It didn’t stay in the air?

38
00:02:56.425 --> 00:02:59.227
Tina: It must have fallen back down.

39
00:02:59.228 --> 00:03:03.436
Hopian: Let me have a look at that, Brad.

40
00:03:03.437 --> 00:03:06.933
Hopian: You used your imagination well, Danny.

41
00:03:06.934 --> 00:03:10.642
Danny: Well, I knew that I had to make a rainbow.

42
00:03:10.643 --> 00:03:13.317
Danny: That’s how we got to Ginormous.

43
00:03:13.318 --> 00:03:16.173
Hopian: I’m not talking about that.

44
00:03:16.174 --> 00:03:19.711
Hopian: I’m talking about how you made the rainbow.

45
00:03:19.712 --> 00:03:22.347
Danny: I had some magic clay left over.

46
00:03:22.348 --> 00:03:24.096
It was easy.

47
00:03:24.097 --> 00:03:27.773
Hopian: Danny, this is not magic clay.

48
00:03:27.774 --> 00:03:31.704
This is regular clay, from your world.

49
00:03:31.705 --> 00:03:34.608
Danny: No. It must have been magic clay.

50
00:03:34.609 --> 00:03:39.430
Danny: If it is normal clay, how did I make the rainbow?

51
00:03:39.431 --> 00:03:42.009
Hopian: Look for yourself, Danny.

52
00:03:42.010 --> 00:03:45.777
This is just regular clay.

53
00:03:45.778 --> 00:03:48.855
Danny: That’s impossible.

54
00:03:48.856 --> 00:03:53.363
Hopian: No, Danny. Your imagination made it possible.

55
00:03:53.364 --> 00:04:00.722
Hopian: It was your imagination, and your imagination alone, that saved us.

56
00:04:00.723 --> 00:04:03.467
Danny: I don’t understand.

57
00:04:03.468 --> 00:04:07.048
Hopian: Imagination is a powerful thing.

58
00:04:07.049 --> 00:04:09.399
Never forget that.

59
00:04:09.400 --> 00:04:17.395
Hopian: If you use it properly, it will help solve many problems [n3@throughout your life.
